#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.3.7.rst:6
msgid "**4.3.7 release of CodeIgniter4**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.3.7.rst:13
msgid "BREAKING"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.3.7.rst:15
msgid ""
"**RouteCollection:** The second parameter ``bool $includeWildcard = "
"true`` has been added to the ``RouteCollection::getRoutes()`` method."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.3.7.rst:17
msgid ""
"**AutoRouting Legacy:** The first parameter of the "
"``AutoRouter::__construct()`` has been changed from "
"``$protectedControllers`` to ``$cliRoutes``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.3.7.rst:19
msgid ""
"**FeatureTestTrait:** When using :ref:`withBodyFormat() <feature-"
"formatting-the-request>`, the priority of the request body has been "
"changed. See :ref:`Upgrading Guide <upgrade-437-feature-testing>` for "
"details."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.3.7.rst:22
msgid ""
"**Validation:** The return value of ``Validation::loadRuleGroup()`` has "
"been changed from \"**rules array**\" to \"**array** of **rules array** "
"and **customErrors array**\" (``[rules, customErrors]``)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.3.7.rst:27
msgid "Changes"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.3.7.rst:29
msgid ""
"The number helper function :php:func:`number_to_amount()`, which "
"previously returned \"1000\", has been corrected to return \"1 thousand\""
" when the number is exactly 1000, for example."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.3.7.rst:34
msgid "Bugs Fixed"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.3.7.rst:36
msgid ""
"**AutoRouting Legacy:** Fixed a bug that when you added a route with "
"``$routes->add()``, the controller's other methods were inaccessible from"
" the web browser."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.3.7.rst:40
msgid ""
"See the repo's `CHANGELOG.md "
"<https://github.com/codeigniter4/CodeIgniter4/blob/develop/CHANGELOG.md>`_"
" for a complete list of bugs fixed."
msgstr ""

